iewSet.download delegates the request to file_response with attachment disposition.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1834,"endLine":1838}]},{"id":"f-identity","kind":"binding","statement":"The authorization helper is evaluated for request.user against the resolved root document.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1417,"endLine":1426}]},{"id":"f-resource","kind":"binding","statement":"The protected authorization resource is root_doc, not the requested version document.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1417,"endLine":1427}]},{"id":"f-control","kind":"control","statement":"The owner-aware view_document check permits the owner or an object-permission grant; failure produces HttpResponseForbidden.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-81f6400744c9c9e9","startLine":624,"endLine":635},{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1421,"endLine":1427}]},{"id":"f-effect","kind":"effect","statement":"If authorization proceeds, file_doc is passed to serve_file, so that selected file document is the served object.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1437,"endLine":1448}]},{"id":"f-condition","kind":"condition","statement":"For a versioned request with an explicit version parameter, effective-file selection resolves from root_doc and the request; otherwise a versioned request without that parameter can use request_doc.","citations":[{"sourceId":"src-7178cab55a635a65","startLine":1388,"endLine":1399}]}],"decisiveMissingFacts":[],"suggestedObservations":[]}]}}],"tokens":{"input":13959,"output":903,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0},"costUsd":null,"durationMs":25199.475099999996,"stopReason":"tool_use"},"schemaValidation":{"valid":true,"diagnostics":[]},"endedAt":"2026-09-27T19:24:07.621Z"}}
